WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two faces. The pixels stay exactly where they are.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But rotate the eyes and mouth within the face.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Invert the whole portrait. A mismatch may become harder to notice.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Return it upright. The wrong features can jump into view.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
This tests visual perception, not the efficacy of meditation recordings.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
See the source, try the free exercise and examine the claims.
